ith | docstring | selftest_c166_eladv.py | 745 |\n1654:| `errorlist_verdict` | extra, missing, predicted_loose=0 | Error List per-class exactness is STOP for every class EXCEPT loose ends. extra/missing = item texts. | docstring | - | 317 |\n2045:### tools/lv_errorlist.py\n2047:shared module; imported by 5 file(s): `tools/bench/diag_c100_verbs_build.py`, `tools/bench/diag_c89_profiler_leg.py`, `tools/bench/diag_errorlist_v0.py`, `tools/errorlist_check.py`, `tools/recipes/stage_d1_m3a4.py`\n2068:| `send_keys` | key, acts, tag, wait_ms=900 | Sends key through gscript._lv_gui (action keys, WaitMs wait_ms, Exception Approved with the error-list EVIDENCE) and appends {act 'keys', key, tag, out} to acts. Returns lv_gui's output text. | side file | - | 409 |\n2073:| `read` | vi_path, out_json=None, maxdepth=14, dump_tree=True, log=print, on_item=None, max_steps=None | Open the Error List for 'vi_path' (already in memory), read every item, close it. | docstring | - | 798 |\n2075:| `main` |  | CLI <vi> [out.json]: opens the VI's panel, reads its Error List with read(vi, out) (default out tools/bench/errorlist_<stem>_<date>.json), prints method, uia_items_exposed, n_reported, item_count; ... | side file | - | 1163 |\n2174:shared module; imported by 692 file(s): `tools/audit_cycle.py`, `tools/bench/build_op_const_loopterm_77.py`, `tools/bench/build_op_termtype.py`, `tools/bench/build_opstopmode_v0.py`, `tools/bench/build_opwiringrules_v0.py`, `tools/bench/c109_errorlist_reverdict.py` ...\n2608:| `el_norm_ocr` | s | An Error List text -> lower-case alphanumerics with the OCR aliases applied (== errorlist_check.norm). Returns a str. | docstring | - | 2831 |\n2609:| `el_class` | it | One Error List item {raw, detail} -> its class: elrule.item_class's local / cond / sr, else input, else | docstring | selftest_t7_ring.py | 2840 |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fe46629c-96d6-4dfa-bbb8-b54890bf1748","uuid":"e787485b-f7b3-4ff3-88ea-c989cce19789","timestam